g><br>Fight in 100% of your environment. You\u2019re not limited to where you can reach on foot. Each Anthrobot is outfitted with a fully customizable flight rig. High-speed aerial maneuvers allow you to take full advantage of the arena's massive vertical play space. Play the ground game, or take to the skies; this is dog-fighting at its best!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free to Play </h2></strong><br>Insula: Bounty Royale is completely free to play. Anything that is made available in the store can be earned by playing the game. This includes your Bounty Pass, which leads to more unlocks and amazing loot.",
